# End the active dictation session and save the captured text.
[(can you|can we|let's)] (stop|end|cancel|terminate|finish|complete) [taking] dictation
[(can you|can we|let's)] (stop|end|cancel|terminate|finish|complete) (taking notes|note-taking)
[(can you|can we|let's)] (stop|end|cancel|terminate|finish|complete) (capturing text|text capture)
[(can you|can we|let's)] (stop|end|cancel|terminate|finish|complete) [text] transcription
[(can you|can we|let's)] (deactivate|disable) [text] (dictation|transcription) [mode]
i (am|have) (done|finished) with (the dictation|dictation)
i have finished dictating
(stop|quit) (writing|typing) (everything|what) i say
(that's|that is) (all|it) for (the|this) dictation
(you can|please) stop typing
we are (done|finished) (dictating|with the dictation)
no more (dictation|notes) (please|today)
(don't|do not) write (anything|any more) down
